<pending_commit branch="master" change_id="Iaf51f2231000c5036dfa4225d91c2a508d14fade" commit="fdf3c3c9e1362ccf75dc532f1d3b1d19a1e842c8" commit_message="login: Use libcontainer to start arc-instance  Use the newly added libcontainer to start the arc instance directly from session_manager.  This means startup failures will be noticed directly, in the event of a failure the arc_instance_closure will not be called and start will return an error.  There is a bunch of upstart ugliness still here.  There are open bugs to remove most of it.  CQ-DEPEND=CL:*259286 BUG=b/26549867 TEST=Boot system on minnie, play game, logout, login w/different accout, play different game, logout.  Check no stray processes left after logout.  Change-Id: Iaf51f2231000c5036dfa4225d91c2a508d14fade Signed-off-by: Dylan Reid &lt;dgreid@chromium.org&gt; Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/336915 " fail_count="3" gerrit_number="336915" owner_email="dgreid@chromium.org" pass_count="0" patch_number="24" project="chromiumos/platform2" project_url="https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform2" ref="refs/changes/15/336915/24" remote="cros" total_fail_count="3"/><pending_commit branch="master" change_id="I4c1d7829f9d6dc9422c1237a1d5720470ff19273" commit="58f3d20933941619169e9f8d13bc94504ad12b25" commit_message="coreboot: configs: Add IFWI config options to config.reef  CQ-DEPEND=CL:*261367 BUG=chrome-os-partner:53689 BRANCH=None TEST=&quot;emerge-reef coreboot&quot; uses the correct IFWI image.  Change-Id: I4c1d7829f9d6dc9422c1237a1d5720470ff19273 Signed-off-by: Furquan Shaikh &lt;furquan@google.com&gt; Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/348304 Commit-Ready: Furquan Shaikh &lt;furquan@chromium.org&gt; Tested-by: Furquan Shaikh &lt;furquan@chromium.org&gt; Reviewed-by: Aaron Durbin &lt;adurbin@chromium.org&gt; " fail_count="0" gerrit_number="348304" owner_email="furquan@chromium.org" pass_count="0" patch_number="1" project="chromiumos/overlays/chromiumos-